  "instructions": [
    "Season the veal slices with salt, pepper, cumin, coriander, paprika, lemon juice, garlic, and harissa paste.",
    "Vacuum‑seal the seasoned veal in a sous‑vide bag and cook at 56°C for 120 minutes.",
    "Remove the veal from the bag, pat dry, and sear quickly in a hot pan for 30 seconds per side for a golden crust.",
    "Warm the agave leaf over low heat until pliable, then lay it flat on a clean surface.",
    "Spread a generous amount of seared veal on the center of the leaf, top with diced tomatoes, cucumber, and parsley.",
    "Fold the sides of the leaf over the filling and roll tightly to form a wrap.",
    "Slice the wrap in half and serve immediately with a lemon wedge on the side."
  ],
